# Project Structure and Key Flows

- App server: [index.ts](mdc:index.ts) uses Hono to expose simple endpoints; it is not coupled to Convex.
- Convex backend:
  - Schema: [convex/schema.ts](mdc:convex/schema.ts)
  - Functions: [convex/documents.ts](mdc:convex/documents.ts)
  - Tables: `documents`, `chunks` (with vector index `by_embedding` on `embedding` field, dims 1536)
- PDF processing utilities: [pdf/pdf-processor.ts](mdc:pdf/pdf-processor.ts)
  - `extractPageRange`, `ingestPdf`, `createVectorChunks`, `saveExtractedPdf`, `splitPdfToPages`
- Example script: [run-pdf.ts](mdc:run-pdf.ts)

High-level flow

- Extract subset or split pages: `extractPageRange` or `splitPdfToPages`
- Parse text per page: `ingestPdf` (pdfjs-dist)
- Chunk into RAG-ready units: `createVectorChunks`
- Embed and upload to Convex: mutations in [convex/documents.ts](mdc:convex/documents.ts)
- Query via semantic search action: `semanticSearch` in [convex/documents.ts](mdc:convex/documents.ts)
